            <span class="lvg-truth-chapters__label">
              Chapter two
            </span>
          

          
            <h2>
              You did not choose <br>
the skin you started with.
            </h2>
          

          

            <div class="lvg-truth-chapters__two">

              
                <div>
                  <p>Everyone begins with a different inheritance — tendencies in pigmentation, in sebum, in sensitivity, in barrier strength, in collagen architecture, in how visibly and how early skin ages.</p>
                </div>
              

              
                <div>
                  <p>That starting point is then shaped by everything since. Age, sun, pollution, sleep, stress and the routine itself all leave their marks.</p>
                </div>
              

            </div>

          

