              Chapter four
            </span>
          

          
            <h2>
              The real problem is within. <br>
So is the real solution.
            </h2>
          

          

            <div class="lvg-truth-chapters__two">

              
                <div>
                  <p>That symmetry is the point, and it is why this part sits between the loop and the answer. The lottery sets the starting point from within. The regenerative system keeps working from within. Nothing applied to the surface changes the first one — and everything worth applying is aimed at the second.</p>
                </div>
              

              

            </div>

          

