              <span class="lvg-truth-chapters__refusal-heading">
                What this argument does not say
              </span>

            


            

              <div class="lvg-truth-chapters__refusal-content">
                <p>That your concerns do not matter. They are the scorecard. A scorecard is not nothing — it is simply not the game.</p><p>That "within" means wellness. Within means cell turnover, barrier replenishment and matrix maintenance. All three are physical, and all three can be measured.</p><p>That skincare rewrites genetics. It does not, and nothing here will claim it does. The starting point stays set. What changes is how close to its own best the skin gets to run.</p><p>That any of this happens quickly. Seventy-five days is the honest number, and it is honest precisely because it is inconvenient.</p>
              </div>

            


            

